{"title":"Math Olympiads for Elementary and Middle Schools","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><b>Math Olympiads for Elementary and Middle Schools</b> (<b>MOEMS</b>) is a large and popular <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition\" title=\"Mathematics competition\">mathematics competition</a> for students in grades 4 through 8.  The goal of MOEMS is to expose students to elementary methods of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematical_problem_solving\" title=\"Mathematical problem solving\">mathematical problem solving</a>.\n</p>\n<table style=\"border:thin solid black;padding:10px;float:right;margin:10px;background:#fff;\">\n\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"border:thin solid gray;text-align:center;background:#ccf;\"><b>MOEMS</b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Region</b>: USA\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Type</b>: Free Response\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS_Wiki:Competition_ratings\" title=\"AoPS Wiki:Competition ratings\">Difficulty</a></b>: 1\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><b>Difficulty Breakdown:</b>\n<p><u>Division E</u>: 1<br /><u>Division M</u>: 1\n</p>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Math_Jams\">Math Jams</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_Olympiads_for_Elementary_and_Middle_Schools&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Math Jams\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>MOEMS Executive Director <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Richard_Kalman\" title=\"Richard Kalman\">Richard Kalman</a> and many talented MOEMS PICO's run online <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_Jam\" title=\"Math Jam\">Math Jams</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Art_of_Problem_Solving\" title=\"Art of Problem Solving\">Art of Problem Solving</a>.  These Math Jams are designed to help PICOs learn new ways to teach <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematical_problem_solving\" title=\"Mathematical problem solving\">mathematical problem solving</a> to MOEMS students.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"MOEMS_Resources\">MOEMS Resources</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_Olympiads_for_Elementary_and_Middle_Schools&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: MOEMS Resources\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li>The <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"//www.moems.org\">Official Website</a></li>\n<li><a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/store/list/other-products#MOEMS\">MOEMS Books</a> at <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a></li>\n<li>The <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/c343\">MOEMS Forum</a> on <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AoPS\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"AoPS\">AoPS</a> as well as a private <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/community/h38770\">MOEMS Teachers Forum</a>.</li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_Olympiads_for_Elementary_and_Middle_Schools&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<ul><li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of mathematics competitions\">List of mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_elementary_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions\">List of United States elementary school mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=List_of_United_States_middle_school_mathematics_competitions\" title=\"List of United States middle school mathematics competitions\">List of United States middle school mathematics competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Mathematics_competition_resources\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Mathematics competition resources\">Mathematics competition resources</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Academic_competitions\" title=\"Academic competitions\">Academic competitions</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Math_books\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Math books\">Math books</a></li></ul>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261018002746\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.019 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.068 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 45/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 457/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 66/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 0/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%    7.052      1 Template:Contest_Info\n100.00%    7.052      1 -total\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:1458:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261018002746 and revision id 271066. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}